<p><br />BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHT GOD, <br />MAY ALL WHO PASS BY THIS WAY,<br />CARRY IN THEIR SACRED HEARTS,<br />THE MEMORIES OF ALL THOSE WHO<br />FOUGHT AND DIED SO THAT WE<br />MAY ALL LIVE IN FREEDOM.</p>
