<p>JOHN BAXTER<br />SIDNEY BETTS<br />WILLIAM BRIGGS<br />WILLIAM CARR<br />CLARENCE COULTER<br />CECIL DARKINS<br />CLARENCE L.A. DAVERN<br />WILLIAM E. FITZGERALD<br />WILLIAM GROSJEAN<br />STANLEY HARE<br />ARTHUR HENNESSY<br />HARRY F. HITCHINS<br />ROBERT JOBSON<br />DONALD LESLIE-YOUNG<br />ALLAN MCMASTER<br />WELLINGTON R. METCALF<br />ALEXANDER PATTERSON<br />FRANK D. RICHARDSON<br />WILLIAM H. RITTWAGE<br />ROBERT R. RITTWAGE<br />GEORGE H. ROWLEY<br />WALTER TAYLOR<br />JOHN TOUGH<br />GEORGE WAITE<br />FRANK WANNAMAKER<br />C. BURTON WILKINS<br />EDWARD WILSON<br />FRANK WILSON<br />WILLIAM WINDOVER</p>
