<p>LYALL ARMSTRONG<br />PAUL EVERETT COLTMAN<br />CARL MAX DOONAN<br />RALPH GORDON DUNN<br />DONALD GRANT GOODFELLOW<br />CLIFTON WATT HARPER, D.F.C.<br />DONALD STUART REDDY HEPBURN<br />REGINALD LIONEL REDDY HEPBURN<br />GERALD ORVILLE JACKSON<br />CLARKE LYNSON LAWSON<br />GERALD THOMSPON MUTTON<br />ARTHUR RAYMOND SOMMERVILLE<br />SAMUEL JACKSON SWAIN</p>
