<p>1914 &ndash; 1919<br /> Honour Roll<br /> MacKay Presbyterian Church<br /> Ottawa<br /> In grateful and honoured memory of those of this<br /> church who served in the Great War in<br /> defence of justice, truth and righteousness<br /> And for the glory of God.</p>
