<p>Sacred to the memory of<br /> Captain William Thornton Bate, R.N.<br /> of H.M.S. Actaeon<br /> who was killed at Canton at the storming of the city<br /> December 29<sup>th</sup> 1857<br /> His distinguished career and Christian virtues<br /> endeared him to the foreign community in China<br /> who erected a monument to his memory at Hong Kong</p>
